silm:instances_papers_04_forge_chapters_02_typing_law_sections_03_negative_regression_catalog_concrete_anchor_3 silm:hasExample "In 'ConcreteAnchor — 03_negative_regression_catalog #3', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, The taxon identifier TSN 183798 — a numeric identifier in the ITIS taxonomy database. This is a node of type TaxonIdentifier, not of type Individual. Regression k2 blocks TSN 183798 → Mittens directly.." .
